sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Client Browser
    participant UI as User MFE (:3003)
    participant Shell as Storefront Shell (:3000)
    participant GW as API Gateway (:8080)
    participant US as User Service (:8081)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (user_db)

    User->>UI: Submit Login (admin@ecommerce.com / password123)
    UI->>GW: POST /api/users/login
    GW->>US: Forward Login Payload
    US->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>US: User Entity (BCrypt Password Hash)
    US->>US: passwordEncoder.matches(raw, hash)
    US->>US: Mint JWT (HMAC-SHA256, roles=['ROLE_ADMIN'])
    US-->>GW: Return Token & User Profile
    GW-->>UI: 200 OK + JWT Bearer Token
    UI->>Shell: Dispatch Token to Global Redux Store
    Shell-->>User: Update Header (Display "Welcome, Admin")
